{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sefirot lives through eight lifetimes, carrying the full weight of her memories from one to the next.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dayflies, born to live only a single day, leave their memories written on leaves, hoping the next will read and remember.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>At the grave of her beloved, now gone after his eighth and final life, Sefirot meets a dayfly. She agrees to help her find the scattered leaves that hold the forgotten stories of her kind.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Day in a Life of a Dayfly\u00a0\u2014\u00a0<i>a visual novel that came from nowhere but was made with love.</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd8b Unique\u00a0artwork \u2014 a blend of illustrations and photography.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf43 Original music (menu theme).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How to Play:</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf43 Check each character\u2019s \u201cStatus\u201d tab in the menu and examine the memory leaves in your inventory to better understand their inner world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd8b Unlock two endings based on your choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3778680?t=1753977773","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778680/7e9af643982713c6422b5199fddaadbed683392b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753977773","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778680/692f2e81611e8d7ce981481a2e7492a7ae23e056/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753977773","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778680/692f2e81611e8d7ce981481a2e7492a7ae23e056/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753977773","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Reflections on Mortality and Meaning."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sefirot lives through eight lifetimes, carrying the full weight of her memories from one to the next.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dayflies, born to live only a single day, leave their memories written on leaves, hoping the next will read and remember.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>At the grave of her beloved, now gone after his eighth and final life, Sefirot meets a dayfly. She agrees to help her find the scattered leaves that hold the forgotten stories of her kind.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Day in a Life of a Dayfly\u00a0\u2014\u00a0<i>a visual novel that came from nowhere but was made with love.</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd8b Unique\u00a0artwork \u2014 a blend of illustrations and photography.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf43 Original music (menu theme).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How to Play:</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf43 Check each character\u2019s \u201cStatus\u201d tab in the menu and examine the memory leaves in your inventory to better understand their inner world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd8b Unlock two endings based on your choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["games from nowhere"],"dlc":[3900100],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_